38414>>>                Case Break
38415>>>
38415>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38415>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38415>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38415>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38416>>>
38416>>>        Case End
